{"unit":6,"items":30,"pass":21,"title":"Unit Test · Unit 6","html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Unit Test\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Unit 6 &middot; Unit Test</div>\n      <h2>People</h2>\n      <p data-t=\"gx257\">Thirty questions on Unit 6 only. Answer them all, then press Check. You need <b>21 out of 30</b> to pass &mdash; and you can take this test as many times as you like.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"review-u6\">\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u6r101\">Part 1 &middot; Grammar &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 1&ndash;14</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u6r102\">Choose the correct form.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">She is &hellip; than her brother.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">more patient</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">patienter</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">This is &hellip; book I have ever read.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">the best</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">the better</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">best</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">He is not as &hellip; as his sister.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">confident</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">more confident</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">Today is &hellip; than yesterday.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">more hot</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">hotter</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">the hottest</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u6r103\">Put the verb in brackets into the correct form.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">(<i>live</i>) I <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"have lived|'ve lived|have been living\" data-why=\"<i>Since</i> + unfinished time &rarr; Present Perfect: <b>have lived</b>.\"> here since 2019.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">(<i>move</i>) They <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"moved\" data-why=\"<i>In 2010</i> is finished time &rarr; Past Simple: <b>moved</b>.\"> to Astana in 2010.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"body\">(<i>never / be</i>) She <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"has never been|'s never been\" data-why=\"Experience, no time given &rarr; <b>has never been</b>.\"> to Paris.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u6r104\">Choose the correct word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">8</span><span class=\"body\">Have you finished &hellip; ?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">yet</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">already</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">just</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">9</span><span class=\"body\">No, thank you &mdash; I&rsquo;ve &hellip; eaten.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">yet</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">already</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">just</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">10</span><span class=\"body\">He has &hellip; arrived &mdash; he&rsquo;s still in the hall.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">just</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">yet</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">already</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u6r105\">Each sentence has one wrong word. Click it.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">11</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"2\" data-why=\"<i>Yesterday</i> is finished time, so the Past Simple: <i>I <b>saw</b> him yesterday</i>.\"><span class=\"ew\">I</span> <span class=\"ew\">have</span> <span class=\"ew\">seen</span> <span class=\"ew\">him</span> <span class=\"ew\">yesterday</span></span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">12</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"3\" data-why=\"Short adjectives take <i>-er</i> only: <i>taller than me</i>, not <b>more</b> taller.\"><span class=\"ew\">She</span> <span class=\"ew\">is</span> <span class=\"ew\">more</span> <span class=\"ew\">taller</span> <span class=\"ew\">than</span> <span class=\"ew\">me</span></span></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u6r106\">Write the sentence again so that it means the same.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">13</span><span class=\"body\">My brother is younger than me.<br>I am <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"older than my brother|older than him\" data-why=\"Turn the comparison round: <b>older than my brother</b>.\"> .</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">14</span><span class=\"body\">I started this job in 2020 and I still work here.<br>I <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"have worked here since 2020|'ve worked here since 2020|have been working here since 2020\" data-why=\"Started in the past, still true &rarr; <b>have worked here since 2020</b>.\"> .</span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u6r107\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 2 &middot; Vocabulary &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 15&ndash;24</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u6r108\">Complete each sentence with one word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">15</span><span class=\"body\">He never says a word in a big group. He is very <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"shy\" data-why=\"<b>Shy</b> = nervous and uncomfortable with people you do not know.\">.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">16</span><span class=\"body\">She is happiest with people around her. She is an <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"extrovert\" data-why=\"An <b>extrovert</b> is happiest with other people and says what they think openly.\">.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">17</span><span class=\"body\">My husband&rsquo;s mother is my <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"mother-in-law|mother in law\" data-why=\"Your husband&rsquo;s or wife&rsquo;s mother is your <b>mother-in-law</b>.\">.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">18</span><span class=\"body\">Two children born to the same mother at the same time are <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"twins\" data-why=\"<b>Twins</b> are born to the same mother at the same time.\">.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">19</span><span class=\"body\">They ended their marriage last year. They got <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"divorced\" data-why=\"<b>Get divorced</b> = end a marriage legally.\">.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u6r109\">Choose the correct word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">20</span><span class=\"body\">He never tells the truth. He is &hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">unkind</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">dishonest</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">untidy</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">21</span><span class=\"body\">You waited five minutes and then started shouting. You are very &hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">impatient</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">impolite</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">unlucky</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">22</span><span class=\"body\">Nobody can do that. It is &hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">unnecessary</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">impossible</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">unfair</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u6r110\">One word in each group does not belong. Click it.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">23</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"4\" data-why=\"The others are positive characteristics. <b>Stupid</b> is not.\"><span class=\"ew\">confident</span> <span class=\"ew\">sociable</span> <span class=\"ew\">hard-working</span> <span class=\"ew\">stupid</span></span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">24</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"4\" data-why=\"The others are people. A <b>characteristic</b> is a quality.\"><span class=\"ew\">twins</span> <span class=\"ew\">stepmother</span> <span class=\"ew\">father-in-law</span> <span class=\"ew\">characteristic</span></span></span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u6r111\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 3 &middot; Function &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 25&ndash;30</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u6r112\">Choose the correct phrase.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">25</span><span class=\"body\">&hellip; ! I&rsquo;ve just passed my driving test.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Guess what</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Guess it</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">What guess</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">26</span><span class=\"body\">Your friend says: &ldquo;I&rsquo;ve got the job!&rdquo; You say&hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">&ldquo;That&rsquo;s fantastic news!&rdquo;</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">&ldquo;What a nightmare!&rdquo;</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">&ldquo;Never mind.&rdquo;</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">27</span><span class=\"body\">Have you &hellip; the news about Aiman?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">heard</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">hear</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">hearing</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u6r113\">Complete with one word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">28</span><span class=\"body\">I&rsquo;ve <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"already\" data-why=\"<b>Already</b> = sooner than expected, in a positive sentence.\"> called her &mdash; she cried!</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">29</span><span class=\"body\"><input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"Congratulations|congratulations\" data-why=\"<b>Congratulations!</b> &mdash; the standard reply to somebody&rsquo;s success.\">! You really deserve it.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u6r114\">Put the three lines of the exchange in the usual order.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">30</span><span class=\"body\">\n        <div class=\"order\" data-order=\"r1,r2,r3\">\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r2\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">Congratulations! That&rsquo;s fantastic news.</span></button>\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r3\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">Have you told your mum yet?</span></button>\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r1\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">Guess what! I&rsquo;ve just passed my driving test.</span></button>\n        </div>\n      </span></div>\n\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"checkReview(this)\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Check my answers</button>\n      <div class=\"res\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"reviewResult\" class=\"review-result\"></div>\n  </section>\n"}